{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 Welcome to Semester 2 \u2014 Where Nothing Stays Hidden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new semester. A campus full of ambition, desire, and people with things to hide. And somewhere out there, someone watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/b654b82c27db503e6024a575fe38849e.poster.avif?t=1771972445\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/b654b82c27db503e6024a575fe38849e.webm?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/b654b82c27db503e6024a575fe38849e.mp4?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >University Days Semester 2 is a choice-driven adult visual novel set in the messy, electric world of university life. Navigate power games, complicated relationships, and a deepening conspiracy as you build \u2014 or burn \u2014 your reputation across campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back from Season 1 or stepping onto campus for the first time, it doesn't matter \u2014 Semester 2 is a complete standalone experience. All 18+ episodes come as free updates throughout Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/a93529e006aa1a79ad3f68ef6f101dd3.poster.avif?t=1771972445\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/a93529e006aa1a79ad3f68ef6f101dd3.webm?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/a93529e006aa1a79ad3f68ef6f101dd3.mp4?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 Your choices shape everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who you trust. Who you pursue. Who you push away. Your relationships, your reputation, even the scenes you unlock \u2014 all of it shifts based on what you do. Small decisions leave echoes. You live with the consequences here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Someone Is Watching</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'X' was watching you last semester. Now they're making moves. New clues, new leverage, new threats with every episode. The closer you get to the truth, the more dangerous things get \u2014 for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf1 The Phone Changes Everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game phone isn't a menu. It's a whole other layer of the story. Late-night texts, Picstagram scrolling, photo swaps, private conversations that would never happen face to face. Some of the semester's biggest moments happen entirely on that screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/1dc24fbddf53e6df474659fc6bd12fc4.poster.avif?t=1771972445\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/1dc24fbddf53e6df474659fc6bd12fc4.webm?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/1dc24fbddf53e6df474659fc6bd12fc4.mp4?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Story-Rich Adult Scenes Fully illustrated, explicit encounters that are actually part of the story \u2014 not afterthoughts. Returning faces, bold new characters, and moments that carry weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 Immersive Phone &amp; Social Feed Real-time messages, a Picstagram feed, photo exchanges. The things your classmates and teachers would never say out loud \u2014 but might type at midnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f The Mystery of 'X' Deepens A puppet master with a long game and a lot of leverage. Every episode adds another piece. None of them are comforting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfeb New Classes, New Power Plays Miss Varela is volatile. Miss Cross is calculating. Every teacher on campus has an agenda, and what you let slip in their presence has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Choices That Echo Your past decisions reshape future scenes, open new paths, and permanently close others. This isn't a story you can course-correct your way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b Bonus Gallery &amp; Unlockables Over a dozen standalone scenes \u2014 fantasies, alternate dynamics, moments that exist just outside the edges of the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Nine Additional Languages French, Italian, Polish, Portuguese, Spanish, German, Russian, Chinese (Simplified), and Turkish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.poster.avif?t=1771972445\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.webm?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.mp4?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple episodes available at launch. All 18+ episodes arrive as free updates throughout Early Access \u2014 nothing else to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains explicit adult content for players aged 18 and over.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Semester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/3e85732105e573fb840a8dae74b90d7a8dc2d8ea.jpg"},{"name":"My New Phone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/fd7a99ef9961b08d112c58406046e11aab9aad42.jpg"},{"name":"Just Me and Rose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/be26cddea37151eb7c5f21ef92e6d2d839f9ee27.jpg"},{"name":"A Nice Shower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/9c9d9c2a5751c930205906f73dae6e75ef988d66.jpg"},{"name":"Laptop Browser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/97496520f3514ab724762bdbc1d7caee90e28b39.jpg"},{"name":"Fighting Lessons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/709d860cf44591da3ff66acbe75756d28a1f83e5.jpg"},{"name":"2 Is Better Than 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/6565861a4daed6338c1eabae99a99d2cb2db2eab.jpg"},{"name":"Bus Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/7dc0bf9e17dc806057ca3b5d0ea2d8fdec3408b8.jpg"},{"name":"Frequent Walker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3403700/9cf3b0038a5f3d8dec099f9a0288af092a1f0b90.jpg"}],"total":9},"backgr