 Every episode adds another piece. None of them are comforting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfeb New Classes, New Power Plays Miss Varela is volatile. Miss Cross is calculating. Every teacher on campus has an agenda, and what you let slip in their presence has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Choices That Echo Your past decisions reshape future scenes, open new paths, and permanently close others. This isn't a story you can course-correct your way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b Bonus Gallery &amp; Unlockables Over a dozen standalone scenes \u2014 fantasies, alternate dynamics, moments that exist just outside the edges of the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Nine Additional Languages French, Italian, Polish, Portuguese, Spanish, German, Russian, Chinese (Simplified), and Turkish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.poster.avif?t=1771972445\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.webm?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3250c60a5497fdc900d3add93b337e3b.mp4?t=1771972445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple episodes available at launch. All 18+ episodes arrive as free updates throughout Early Access \u2014 nothing else to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains explicit adult content for players aged 18 and over.</p>","developers":["Greebo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description